<B>6.  SETTLEMENT PATTERN ANALYSIS IN ARCHAEOLOGY</B><P><B>
</B><B>Jeffery Parsons</B>.  Archaeological settlement patterns.  <I>Annual Review of 
Anthropology </I>1 (1972):127-150.<P>
<B>Stephen H. Savage</B>.  Modelling the late archaic social landscape.  <I>Interpreting Space:  GIS 
