<B>7.  DATA SOURCES, PREPROCESSING, AND GEOCODING</B><P><B>
</B><B>Jeffery Star and John Estes</B>.  <I>Geographic Information Systems:  An 
Introduction.</I>  Englewood Cliffs, New Jersey:  Prentice Hall, 1991.  (Chs. 5 and 6)<P>
<B>8.  SITE CATCHMENT ANALYSIS IN ARCHAEOLOGY</B><P><B>
</B><B>Eleazer D. Hunt</B>.  Upgrading site-catchment analyses with the use of GIS:  investigating 
